WEBVTT

00:08.440 --> 00:11.410
Koi seyo shounen shoujo tachi

00:11.870 --> 00:14.900
Kirari hitomi ni hoshi irete

00:15.480 --> 00:18.610
Umareta manma no jounetsu ga

00:19.080 --> 00:22.480
Hibana chirasu Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

00:22.820 --> 00:25.910
Mekurumeku koshitsuki MUCHO

00:26.450 --> 00:29.390
Kodomo nya kiwadoi AMIGO

00:29.890 --> 00:33.120
Kisu shitara suikomaresou

00:33.460 --> 00:36.160
Kowai mono mitasa TONIGHT

00:37.230 --> 00:39.100
Ojikeduitara dame

00:39.100 --> 00:40.870
Oshite osarete GOING

00:40.870 --> 00:42.740
Dokkiri kibun ga iine

00:42.740 --> 00:44.500
Chakkari asa made DANCING

00:44.810 --> 00:46.240
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:46.240 --> 00:50.040
TROPICANA

00:51.750 --> 00:54.650
Yashi no kokage de tsukamaete

00:55.180 --> 00:58.350
Jirashite tokoton tokoton

00:58.950 --> 01:01.920
Gomen ne anata wa mou toriko

01:02.560 --> 01:05.620
Nigerarenai Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

01:06.160 --> 01:09.060
Koi seyo shounen shoujo tachi

01:09.560 --> 01:12.730
Kirari hitomi ni hoshi irete

01:13.400 --> 01:16.390
Umareta manma no jounetsu ga

01:16.840 --> 01:20.240
Hibana chirasu Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

01:27.650 --> 01:31.020
Ojou-sama, Haré-sama, please wake up!

01:31.490 --> 01:33.680
It's breakfast time!

01:34.320 --> 01:35.690
Ojou-sama?

01:37.860 --> 01:40.830
Wendy, Age 17

01:41.330 --> 01:43.020
Now, eat up!

01:46.940 --> 01:49.460
I don't want any... I've got no appetite.

01:49.640 --> 01:51.430
I'm in pain...

01:51.570 --> 01:52.840
I'm sorry, me too...

01:53.010 --> 01:54.210
Oh, I see...

01:54.210 --> 01:56.540
You don't have an appetite,
you're in pain, and you too...

01:56.610 --> 01:59.340
Wait, Ojou-sama, what's wrong?
Where does it hurt?

01:59.410 --> 02:01.820
Ashio! Ojou-sama's in danger!

02:01.820 --> 02:03.720
Ojou-sama!

02:03.790 --> 02:05.180
I'm going to die...

02:06.520 --> 02:08.510
Get a hold of yourself, Ojou-sama!

02:08.590 --> 02:11.650
Senpai, you have to leave people alone
when they have a hangover.

02:11.730 --> 02:14.460
Why are you so calm?
Hurry up and call a doctor!

02:14.460 --> 02:16.190
Our lady is about to die from a hangover...

02:17.500 --> 02:18.430
A hangover?

02:23.970 --> 02:26.770
Ojou-san, all things considered, you've been
drinking too much lately.

02:26.880 --> 02:29.070
Now that you've mentioned it,
I can smell the alcohol...

02:29.140 --> 02:31.170
But, it can't be that Haré-sama also...

02:31.350 --> 02:33.410
Bocchan's just been
playing too many games.

02:34.320 --> 02:35.440
Bulls-eye.

02:35.650 --> 02:38.740
Oh, no, that's not good.
Drinking too much is bad for you.

02:38.850 --> 02:40.340
You're so weak.

02:40.420 --> 02:43.520
Guu feels perfectly fine, even after
swallowing 10 or 20 people.

02:43.590 --> 02:44.960
That's not the same "swallow"
we're talking about!

02:45.130 --> 02:47.330
In the first place,
what do you mean, 10 or 20 people?!

02:47.330 --> 02:48.560
Have you ever drank before!?

02:50.060 --> 02:51.330
Well, let's try...

02:51.400 --> 02:53.530
You don't have to try!
I'm sorry for doubting you. Stop it!

02:54.040 --> 02:55.670
Unhealthy living is the cause of all illness.

02:55.670 --> 02:56.970
We have to fix this.

02:57.110 --> 02:59.940
Actually, it's all because
of you two, Bell and Ashio.

03:00.710 --> 03:05.300
My work - cleaning, laundry -
all done by you two.

03:05.510 --> 03:08.040
Come on, almost all of those were my
chores...

03:08.150 --> 03:11.740
And thanks to that, I've gotten super-bored,
and end up drinking too much.

03:12.150 --> 03:13.920
Oh, I hate this, I really hate this...

03:13.990 --> 03:18.020
But, oh well,
I can't say such a thing to their face.

03:18.530 --> 03:21.860
Ashio! Ojou-sama is saying that it's your
fault! Do something about it!

03:22.330 --> 03:24.230
She just said that it was both our fault...

03:24.230 --> 03:25.290
Don't talk back to me!

03:25.530 --> 03:28.970
You have to think of an
Ojou-sama Health Plan.

03:32.670 --> 03:35.170
Ashio, you lead a very unhealthy life, too...

03:37.910 --> 03:39.000
What are you doing?

03:39.980 --> 03:43.140
This is the latest fad - something called
"hanging to be healthy."

03:44.290 --> 03:49.090
I don't know if it's a fad or not, but I'm sure
that the way you're doing it is wrong!

03:52.230 --> 03:54.390
Oh, while you're at it, can you get me the
dictionary, Ravenna?

03:54.460 --> 03:56.760
Geez, you should look for it yourself.

03:58.930 --> 04:00.760
My head is finally staring to clear up...

04:03.740 --> 04:08.610
You brats, you heard that second period
today was your health exam, right?

04:10.350 --> 04:14.580
What I hate more than anything else is to not
have my work go smoothly...

04:14.580 --> 04:16.350
...because of someone else's incompetence!

04:17.050 --> 04:18.420
I'll wait for 10 more minutes.

04:19.020 --> 04:21.050
10 minutes. You guys better come
immediately.

04:23.790 --> 04:27.850
If you make me wait any longer than that, I
won't be responsible for what happens.

04:31.270 --> 04:32.230
So scary...

04:32.230 --> 04:34.670
Since he's so angry,
we're already in a bad situation...

04:34.740 --> 04:36.530
But, a health exam?

04:36.600 --> 04:37.740
Did you know about it?

04:37.740 --> 04:39.400
I didn't know.

04:39.470 --> 04:41.030
Didn't anyone hear about it?

04:41.110 --> 04:43.580
If anyone did,
I think it would be my big brother.

04:43.750 --> 04:46.180
Geez... it's all thanks to
Lazy forgetting to tell us.

04:46.280 --> 04:49.580
Jeez, Sensei, you better tell the doc that us
students aren't to blame!

04:54.290 --> 04:56.350
I think the problem is simpler
than forgetting to tell us.

04:56.490 --> 04:57.650
You know...

04:58.260 --> 04:59.420
Wake up!

05:01.300 --> 05:02.130
Hey!

05:03.460 --> 05:05.190
Is he really asleep?

05:05.430 --> 05:06.490
D-Damn you!

05:06.570 --> 05:09.160
Hey, this is no time for us to be playing
around with our teacher!

05:09.270 --> 05:11.300
That's true. We better hurry over... I'm
scared of what's to come if we didn't.

05:11.440 --> 05:13.000
Hurry up, and split up by gender.

05:13.110 --> 05:15.440
For now, why don't we
have the boys go first?

05:15.510 --> 05:16.500
All right, let's go.

05:18.480 --> 05:19.610
Wait a minute.

05:19.810 --> 05:22.680
Why did Guu tell us just now to have the
boys go first?

05:23.950 --> 05:25.320
Think hard, Haré!

05:25.390 --> 05:28.690
When has Guu ever coerced me into doing
anything without an ulterior motive?

05:28.920 --> 05:31.410
No! Every single time,
she's always had a secret agenda!

05:31.830 --> 05:33.560
What is it? What is it?

05:33.630 --> 05:35.220
What's she up to this time?

05:35.300 --> 05:36.230
I get it.

05:38.630 --> 05:39.860
Wait a minute, guys.

05:39.970 --> 05:42.200
What is it? We have to hurry,
or that school doc...

05:42.270 --> 05:43.430
Exactly! The doctor...

05:43.500 --> 05:45.470
Right now, he's at the
peak of his anger, right?

05:45.570 --> 05:48.440
If the boys were to go first
while he's in such a mood...

05:50.210 --> 05:52.770
Don't you think his mood would get worse,
and we'd be in a big mess?

05:52.850 --> 05:53.780
I see.

05:53.850 --> 05:56.440
But, if the girls are first...

06:00.120 --> 06:04.320
I think it'd be better if the
girls went first, to calm him down.

06:05.490 --> 06:06.390
I see!

06:08.200 --> 06:09.190
I won...

06:09.360 --> 06:12.130
All right, let's have the girls go first.

06:12.330 --> 06:13.300
Come on, go.

06:14.100 --> 06:15.870
Don't be wasting time here,
hurry up and get going.

06:15.970 --> 06:17.310
You're so cruel, Haré.

06:17.310 --> 06:20.210
We don't know what he's going to do to us,
but you're making us go first?

06:20.640 --> 06:21.440
That's right.

06:21.510 --> 06:22.540
I didn't mean it that way...

06:22.540 --> 06:22.910
Shut up!
I didn't mean it that way...

06:22.910 --> 06:23.310
I didn't mean it that way...

06:23.380 --> 06:26.140
After all, we all treasure our
own safety the most!

06:26.350 --> 06:27.580
That can't be!

06:27.650 --> 06:28.050
Right?

06:28.680 --> 06:30.450
Haré, I can't believe you think that way!

06:30.520 --> 06:31.450
You're so cruel.

06:31.750 --> 06:34.380
It's as if I was some evil villain or something.

06:34.660 --> 06:35.920
Come on, hurry up and get going.

06:35.920 --> 06:37.980
At the least, be careful to not get anything
strange shot into you.

06:44.970 --> 06:47.130
She calculated things this far!?

06:50.140 --> 06:53.040
Then, I guess I'll go enjoy
this "health exam" thing...

06:53.210 --> 06:55.470
Impossible...
she's going to do something else now!?

06:55.580 --> 06:58.370
So, I don't even get time to be depressed!?

06:58.510 --> 06:59.210
Wait...

06:59.750 --> 07:00.440
What?

07:00.680 --> 07:02.510
You better not do anything uncalled for.

07:03.320 --> 07:04.280
Such as?

07:04.920 --> 07:06.180
For example?

07:06.520 --> 07:10.650
Let's see... like locking up the doc
somewhere, and you doing the check-ups...

07:11.130 --> 07:12.290
I see.

07:12.730 --> 07:14.130
Wait, what are you jotting down!?

07:14.130 --> 07:14.920
What is that?

07:15.200 --> 07:16.290
A routine list.

07:16.400 --> 07:18.020
What do you mean, a routine list?

07:18.400 --> 07:20.870
Don't you dare do anything... got that?

07:22.640 --> 07:23.670
Leave it to me.

07:23.670 --> 07:25.660
Hey! You better not do anything!

07:25.740 --> 07:26.600
Sure.

07:28.110 --> 07:29.940
What, you think Guu's gonna do something?

07:30.010 --> 07:33.380
Well, I can't be sure exactly
what she's up to...

07:34.720 --> 07:36.240
It's worrying.

07:40.320 --> 07:43.050
Look, look! I made a new camisole!

07:43.120 --> 07:44.350
Oh, it's so cute!

07:44.460 --> 07:46.190
Hurry up and take your clothes off.

07:51.500 --> 07:53.360
Next... Marie.

07:53.500 --> 07:54.970
Now, show me your tongue.

07:56.570 --> 07:57.400
Okay.

07:58.140 --> 07:59.500
Now show me your belly.

08:05.250 --> 08:06.650
Okay, that's good enough.

08:06.980 --> 08:08.240
Nothing wrong...

08:08.880 --> 08:11.780
You guys are so healthy that there's no need
for me to do a checkup.

08:11.920 --> 08:14.650
Oh, but this thing doesn't have your blood
types written down.

08:14.720 --> 08:16.280
I guess I'll take blood samples just in case...

08:16.390 --> 08:18.450
Oh, and I should measure
their height and weight.

08:19.460 --> 08:20.650
That hurt.

08:21.200 --> 08:22.630
Oh, you're up last, Guu.

08:22.700 --> 08:23.250
Next!

08:26.330 --> 08:29.360
Then, I'll go back now to call the boys over.

08:30.170 --> 08:32.310
Now, who's next? Hurry up!

08:32.310 --> 08:34.500
I have to look at them boys after you.

08:41.380 --> 08:42.780
What's the meaning of this?

08:42.780 --> 08:46.010
It's just a small joke.
I thought I'd break the ice a bit.

08:48.120 --> 08:49.090
Thanks.

08:49.660 --> 08:50.650
Show me your tongue.

08:53.660 --> 08:54.990
Tongue. You know, your tongue.

08:55.900 --> 08:57.400
You don't get it, do you...

08:57.400 --> 08:58.700
I'm telling you to stick out your tongue!

08:58.700 --> 08:59.790
Come on, out with it!

09:18.220 --> 09:19.780
It's just me. It's just me.

09:20.150 --> 09:22.280
I'm going to use the stethoscope, so can you
show me your belly?

09:22.360 --> 09:23.290
Belly?

09:23.360 --> 09:24.650
Yeah, your belly! Come on!

09:25.590 --> 09:27.930
Well, for that outfit,
you can just lower the top...

09:30.930 --> 09:32.330
What's with that attitude?

09:32.570 --> 09:34.930
Come on, hurry up,
I still have people after you.

09:44.010 --> 09:46.670
Got it? Don't dare do anything!

09:48.620 --> 09:51.140
Seems like the doc wasn't that cranky.

09:51.220 --> 09:52.950
Your plan worked, Haré.

09:53.020 --> 09:54.450
I wonder if it's okay to go in right now.

09:54.520 --> 09:55.960
It's okay, right?

09:56.060 --> 09:57.150
We're coming in!

10:00.600 --> 10:01.460
Huh?

10:01.530 --> 10:03.050
Nobody's here.

10:05.670 --> 10:07.700
Where did the doc run off to?

10:07.700 --> 10:08.630
He's gone?

10:09.170 --> 10:10.100
Could it be?

10:17.210 --> 10:19.270
Hey! Is anyone here?

10:28.660 --> 10:31.650
U-Um, where's our school doctor?

10:32.130 --> 10:35.760
He had an errand to run,
so he's not here right now...

10:36.730 --> 10:38.700
Hey, she's really pretty.

10:38.830 --> 10:40.230
Hey, sis, who are you?

10:40.570 --> 10:41.500
The substitute.

10:41.570 --> 10:43.700
But, was there someone like this here?

10:45.470 --> 10:46.800
Ah! This person...

10:56.820 --> 10:58.050
She looks a lot like...

11:00.520 --> 11:01.920
Sit down right here.

11:02.120 --> 11:04.990
I'm so lucky that such a pretty woman's
gonna look over me!

11:04.990 --> 11:06.120
I'm going first!

11:06.960 --> 11:08.120
Take your shirt off.

11:13.600 --> 11:16.000
What's with that, all of a sudden?
This is just a normal exam, right?

11:16.500 --> 11:17.840
Show me your tongue.

11:22.210 --> 11:24.730
Isn't that what you use to listen to the heart
beating and the stomach churning and stuff?

11:28.050 --> 11:29.480
What are you doing? That's dangerous!

11:29.620 --> 11:31.480
Hey, is she safe?

11:43.400 --> 11:44.800
Who are you?

11:49.070 --> 11:50.270
What was that woman?

11:50.270 --> 11:51.860
She sure ran off fast.

11:54.980 --> 11:56.440
Hey, doc, are you all right?

11:57.380 --> 11:58.710
Hey, doc!

11:58.780 --> 12:01.300
Isn't it impossible for him to do the exam like
this?

12:01.380 --> 12:02.650
Doesn't that mean we lucked out?

12:02.650 --> 12:04.310
Let's leave him alone and go back to class!

12:04.390 --> 12:05.510
Are you sure we should?

12:05.590 --> 12:07.250
Yeah, it's fine. Let's go.

12:11.530 --> 12:12.990
Who in the world was that?

12:13.330 --> 12:14.260
She sure was pretty.

12:14.330 --> 12:15.960
Gupta, that's the only thing
you've been saying.

12:16.030 --> 12:17.800
Oh, you guys are done already?

12:17.800 --> 12:18.490
Well, yeah.

12:18.800 --> 12:19.890
Where's Guu?

12:20.600 --> 12:21.500
She's not back yet?

12:21.570 --> 12:23.630
She was the last girl to go...

12:23.900 --> 12:25.110
I wonder where she went.

12:25.110 --> 12:27.970
Guu is gone, and that woman appeared...

12:28.180 --> 12:29.160
No, it can't be.

12:33.280 --> 12:34.720
They don't look alike at all!

12:34.720 --> 12:36.210
What am I thinking?

12:37.550 --> 12:38.380
No, wait!

12:39.290 --> 12:42.520
We got this far, so maybe...

12:42.790 --> 12:44.020
Nah, impossible!

12:45.730 --> 12:46.660
Is something wrong?

12:46.860 --> 12:49.230
Oh, maybe Guu already went home.

12:49.300 --> 12:51.260
Class is something that we seem to have,
but not really have.

12:51.330 --> 12:52.890
That's true... I guess you're right.

12:55.470 --> 12:56.490
I'm home!

12:56.570 --> 12:58.440
Have I got a story today!

12:58.510 --> 12:59.770
At school...

12:59.910 --> 13:01.340
Then, sit down here.

13:01.410 --> 13:02.340
Sure.

13:02.410 --> 13:03.510
So she did come home ahead of me.

13:03.510 --> 13:06.240
Guu, if you're coming home early, you
should say so...

13:07.720 --> 13:09.010
What are you doing?

13:09.080 --> 13:10.180
We're playing doctor.

13:10.250 --> 13:11.780
Now, show me your breasts.

13:14.160 --> 13:16.020
That stethoscope... where did she?

13:16.360 --> 13:18.350
No. It can't be.

13:23.430 --> 13:24.420
A white coat...

13:24.770 --> 13:27.070
When Guu wasn't there, that woman showed
up...

13:27.070 --> 13:30.230
...and the stethoscope and the white coat
that the lady had on are here...

13:30.300 --> 13:31.430
Which means...

13:33.010 --> 13:34.300
What am I thinking?

13:34.380 --> 13:36.140
That's so ridiculous. Just think about it,
Haré.

13:36.210 --> 13:41.910
When Guu was gone, that lady showed up,
and that lady's stethoscope and white coat
are right here. That means...

13:47.960 --> 13:50.990
Haré and Guu-chan are at school...

13:50.990 --> 13:53.720
I'm so bored!

13:55.030 --> 13:56.460
Beer, beer...

13:58.330 --> 13:59.700
None!

13:59.770 --> 14:01.030
None! None! NONE!

14:02.970 --> 14:04.940
Ashio! Hurry up and do something about it!

14:05.010 --> 14:06.070
Leave it to me.

14:06.070 --> 14:07.470
I have an idea.

14:08.780 --> 14:09.710
Ojou-san...

14:10.610 --> 14:12.700
How about we go to school to pass the time?

14:12.850 --> 14:15.280
School? To do what?

14:15.350 --> 14:17.220
So, off to school we go.

14:17.220 --> 14:18.480
We're gonna be going now!

14:18.620 --> 14:20.250
Let's go buy beer instead!

14:20.320 --> 14:21.190
No can do.

14:25.530 --> 14:26.650
Good morning, Haré.

14:26.860 --> 14:27.730
Morning.

14:27.800 --> 14:29.630
Is something wrong? You look glum.

14:29.700 --> 14:31.790
Eh? That's not true, I'm cheerful and happy!

14:31.870 --> 14:32.700
I see...

14:33.070 --> 14:35.470
It's not something that you can talk to other
people about...

14:35.740 --> 14:37.730
Now, come on, get to your seats!

14:38.110 --> 14:41.510
Hey, that's strange. Lazy's awake so early in
the morning!

14:41.580 --> 14:42.470
You're right.

14:42.810 --> 14:44.370
Hey, are you mocking your teacher?

14:44.450 --> 14:46.540
When I put my mind to it, something like this
is a piece of cake!

14:46.750 --> 14:49.410
Our TV broke last night, so he wasn't able to
watch his anime.

14:49.480 --> 14:50.540
Oh, I see.

14:50.620 --> 14:52.050
I thought it was something like that.

14:53.620 --> 14:56.090
Well, we have two new
transfer students today.

14:56.590 --> 14:57.720
Marie, did you know about this?

14:57.790 --> 14:59.880
Nope. This is the first time I've heard of it.

15:00.090 --> 15:01.580
All right, you can come in.

15:03.700 --> 15:06.130
Hello! We're the transfer students!

15:06.130 --> 15:07.330
Hold on just a minute there!

15:08.200 --> 15:09.070
Where?

15:09.140 --> 15:10.500
You! You guys!

15:10.570 --> 15:12.330
Can it be that they've figured it out already?

15:12.410 --> 15:14.470
What should we do, Ashio?
It's no good after all!

15:14.540 --> 15:16.170
We can do it. It's fine.
We just have to work on it a little bit more.

15:16.240 --> 15:18.680
Make sure to give the impression
that you're a different person when you
introduce yourself.

15:18.810 --> 15:20.210
A-All right.

15:20.350 --> 15:23.080
I'm W-Wendy! I'm 17!

15:23.150 --> 15:24.080
Enough with the jokes...

15:24.150 --> 15:25.740
There's no fooling anyone
with that false age...

15:25.820 --> 15:30.120
My hobbies are cleaning my room,
redecorating, and cooking!

15:30.190 --> 15:31.350
They are not!

15:31.430 --> 15:33.690
I'm A-Amanda. I'm 15.

15:33.760 --> 15:35.460
There's no 15-year-old that looks like that!

15:35.530 --> 15:37.430
Amanda's a girl's name, right?

15:37.730 --> 15:40.000
Now, the two of you,
squeeze into the back row.

15:40.070 --> 15:40.970
Sure!

15:42.140 --> 15:44.100
I'm Wendy! Nice to meet you!

15:44.440 --> 15:46.210
Now, Mom, what did you come here for?

15:46.210 --> 15:46.830
Why don't you hurry up and go ho...

15:46.910 --> 15:49.600
I'm so jealous that your mom
comes all the way to school!

15:49.680 --> 15:50.740
That's true!

15:50.740 --> 15:51.840
I can't tell her...

15:51.910 --> 15:53.880
Really, I'm so jealous.

15:53.950 --> 15:55.880
Argh, she sounds so false...

15:56.080 --> 15:58.520
Really, Mom, what did you come here for,
dressed up like that?

15:59.050 --> 16:01.080
I thought I'd take the health exam.

16:01.160 --> 16:02.820
H...Health exam!?

16:02.960 --> 16:05.390
That means, you're going
to be looked over by that doctor!?

16:05.460 --> 16:06.720
That would be the case, yes.

16:10.530 --> 16:13.300
Now, let's have a look here!

16:13.870 --> 16:15.060
Take your top off.

16:16.070 --> 16:17.590
Oh, no!

16:17.670 --> 16:19.610
No, no, no, no, no, no, NO!!

16:20.040 --> 16:22.300
But the health exam was yesterday, right?

16:23.440 --> 16:24.380
That's right.

16:24.450 --> 16:25.610
There isn't one today.

16:26.250 --> 16:30.480
Oh, but today, we're having the exam for the
boys that we didn't finish yesterday.

16:31.990 --> 16:34.110
B-B-B-B-B-But, Mom is a woman...

16:34.220 --> 16:35.590
Who's your mom?

16:35.660 --> 16:37.120
Dunno, who could it be?

16:37.290 --> 16:40.020
She's going to push this 17-year-old Wendy
thing to the end, isn't she...

16:40.290 --> 16:42.630
B-But, Wendy's a girl!

16:42.760 --> 16:43.990
There's no need to worry about that.

16:44.100 --> 16:46.290
He's going to look over
the transfer students first.

16:46.530 --> 16:47.730
Her? First? Alone!?

16:47.800 --> 16:49.860
Doc and Mom alone together...

16:49.940 --> 16:53.670
Wendy, you drink too much
so I'm worried about your liver.
Make sure to get a thorough exam.

16:53.740 --> 16:54.500
That's true.

16:54.610 --> 16:58.370
Then, first period will be the health exam for
the transfer students and the boys.

16:59.210 --> 17:00.770
For everyone else, it's study hall.

17:01.050 --> 17:02.240
Then, I'll head over now.

17:02.720 --> 17:05.120
Now, Ojou-san's health will be taken care of!

17:06.250 --> 17:10.920
But, wouldn't it have been all right to have
Dr. Clive look at me personally, instead of
doing something like this?

17:11.230 --> 17:13.460
Well, it's all right. It kills time rather well.

17:13.590 --> 17:14.390
That's true.

17:19.000 --> 17:20.690
I'm gonna go to the bathroom...

17:25.910 --> 17:27.000
What's wrong?

17:27.140 --> 17:27.870
Me, too.

17:28.940 --> 17:30.310
I'm heading to the nurse's office...

17:30.710 --> 17:32.580
You're worried about Weda, aren't you?

17:33.310 --> 17:34.880
Then, you're coming with me.

17:34.880 --> 17:36.610
Thanks, that's so reassuring.

17:43.460 --> 17:44.480
Yes, come in.

17:45.790 --> 17:46.660
Welcome...

17:48.330 --> 17:50.260
Weda-chan, what's with that outfit?

17:50.330 --> 17:51.350
Where's the transfer student?

17:54.740 --> 17:56.730
I'm Wendy, 17 years old!

17:58.170 --> 18:01.940
But, I get to examine Weda-chan now that
she's all grown up...

18:03.110 --> 18:05.170
Then, sit on that bed over there
and wait for a bit.

18:05.280 --> 18:06.210
Sure!

18:08.350 --> 18:11.550
All right! I haven't had anything
good happen to me lately!

18:13.650 --> 18:14.460
W-What should I do?

18:14.460 --> 18:16.420
If I don't do anything, Mom will fall victim to
that perverted school doc...

18:22.600 --> 18:24.760
What should I do? What should I do?
What should I do? What should I do!?

18:28.040 --> 18:29.590
All alone with Weda-chan!

18:29.770 --> 18:31.700
This is the perfect chance for me to start a
wonderful relationship!

18:32.610 --> 18:35.870
But, this would be the time, of all times,
for HER to show up...

18:36.710 --> 18:38.700
No, I'm thinking too much, it's just me...

18:39.580 --> 18:40.510
Doctor?

18:41.080 --> 18:43.070
Oh, sorry about that, then...

18:43.480 --> 18:44.920
...take your top off and sit here.

18:45.990 --> 18:48.620
W-W-W-What should I do?
What should I do? What should I do!?

18:48.620 --> 18:50.210
All right, then get in their way.
W-W-W-What should I do?
What should I do? What should I do!?

18:52.130 --> 18:53.860
She's here!

18:53.860 --> 18:54.850
I-I-I-It must be that old hag! I'm sure of it!

18:54.930 --> 18:56.490
Oh, you mean old Dama?

18:56.560 --> 18:58.120
You're so popular, Doctor.

18:58.200 --> 18:59.720
It would be bad for me to interfere, so I guess
I should go home.

18:59.830 --> 19:00.800
You've got to be kidding!

19:00.870 --> 19:02.530
She gives me nothing but trouble!

19:02.840 --> 19:03.960
What are you doing, Guu!?

19:04.040 --> 19:05.900
They'll catch on that I followed them here!

19:05.970 --> 19:07.340
It's bad for them to find out?

19:07.610 --> 19:09.940
If you're so troubled by her, why don't you
tell her outright?

19:09.940 --> 19:12.910
I do. But she doesn't listen to what others
have to say.

19:13.780 --> 19:17.150
Then, how about you make sure she sees
you being intimate with someone else?

19:17.150 --> 19:18.850
That shows that you're not interested in her.

19:18.920 --> 19:20.780
There's nobody close to me
that I can ask for that!

19:20.850 --> 19:22.060
It doesn't have to be a human...

19:22.060 --> 19:24.050
...it can be a dog, a cat, even a monkey.

19:24.120 --> 19:26.090
You can pretend you're not
interested in humans.

19:26.590 --> 19:28.860
I'm going to get mad at you
if you're being serious...

19:29.030 --> 19:30.760
That's right, Weda-chan,
you can help me pretend!

19:31.300 --> 19:32.130
Me!?

19:32.130 --> 19:33.690
My future is riding on this!

19:33.770 --> 19:35.030
You can act it all out, so please!

19:35.270 --> 19:38.760
Geez! If Mom found out
I was doing something like this,
she'd definitely get angry!

19:38.940 --> 19:40.170
Then, should we leave them alone?

19:40.240 --> 19:41.730
T-That's not what I'm saying, though.

19:41.940 --> 19:44.710
Mom hates people sneaking around more
than anything else.

19:44.850 --> 19:47.140
Then, we don't have to sneak around.

19:49.620 --> 19:50.310
Weda.

19:50.680 --> 19:52.820
Weda, you have such beautiful hair.

19:52.820 --> 19:55.080
It's so shiny and sexy.

19:55.160 --> 19:57.520
I want to hold you as soon as I can.

19:57.620 --> 20:02.650
Oh no, Clive, your bleached hair is damaged
just the right amount, it's wonderful.

20:02.860 --> 20:04.420
I love you.

20:09.840 --> 20:10.890
Mom...

20:11.270 --> 20:12.330
This can't be...

20:14.940 --> 20:16.480
You were that kind of woman!?

20:16.480 --> 20:19.070
Wait, is that the right thing
for a son to be saying?

20:19.150 --> 20:21.450
I'm gonna ditch school and join a gang!

20:21.450 --> 20:23.970
That is the right thing
for a child to be saying.

20:25.320 --> 20:26.980
Let's continue where we left off, Weda-chan.

20:27.050 --> 20:28.110
Go after him, Weda.

20:29.720 --> 20:30.660
Guu-chan...

20:31.790 --> 20:33.780
You have something to tell Haré, right?

20:34.260 --> 20:35.290
Guu-chan...

20:36.000 --> 20:36.990
You're right.

20:44.400 --> 20:45.460
Wait, Haré!

20:56.480 --> 21:01.220
Guu-chan told me that I had something worth
chasing you to tell you...

21:01.620 --> 21:02.650
Guu did?

21:02.720 --> 21:03.710
Mom...

21:04.260 --> 21:05.750
So it's all a misunderstanding.

21:07.330 --> 21:09.350
If you're going home, can you buy some
liquor on the way back?

21:10.060 --> 21:11.390
We're all out.

21:12.570 --> 21:13.930
I'm counting on you!

21:18.410 --> 21:19.870
Happy ending!

21:20.140 --> 21:22.900
Absolutely not!

22:35.180 --> 22:36.250
NEXT EPISODE

22:36.250 --> 22:38.920
It's hard to get to sleep, I feel rather closed in...

22:38.920 --> 22:41.620
Wait a minute! Doc, why are you sleeping in our bed!?

22:41.620 --> 22:43.790
Eh? That old barber woman is stalking you again?

22:43.790 --> 22:44.920
I don't care! Get out!

22:44.920 --> 22:46.460
Geez, if I dont do something about this,
he might hook up with Mom while
he's staying all day in our house...

22:46.460 --> 22:48.260
Geez, if I don't do something about this,
he might hook up with Mom while
he's staying all day in our house...

22:48.260 --> 22:49.960
I sense something bad about this!

22:49.960 --> 22:52.200
Eh? I should just hook the doc up with
someone else?

22:52.200 --> 22:53.270
That's a good idea, but...

22:53.270 --> 22:55.600
Oh, there's one person
head-over-heels for that doc...

22:55.600 --> 22:57.640
It's somewhat close to a taboo,
but I guess I'll go with that.

22:57.640 --> 22:59.970
Yargh! D-Don't come near me!

22:59.970 --> 23:00.170
Next episode of Haré+Guu:

23:00.170 --> 23:01.640
Next episode of Haré+Guu:

23:01.640 --> 23:03.240
Love, Love Grandpa DELUXE

23:03.240 --> 23:04.540
DELUXE

23:04.540 --> 23:05.100
DELUXE
